{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"printed-replacement-part-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"PRINT03-BODY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/prompt.txt","locator":"shape request","sha256":"053c1f0df93c455b1b008dadda5a49bf9417ae823329389521620fa37e8ec688"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Dimensioned intent","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"The rear-left foot uses the 26 by 38 mm mounting rectangle, remains at most 26 mm wide, and increases linearly from 8 mm height at Y=0 to 17 mm at Y=38 with a flat Z=0 mounting face and 3 mm side fillets."},{"id":"PRINT03-HOLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Dimensioned intent","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"Two 3.4 mm through holes lie at (13,9) and (13,29), normal to the mounting face."},{"id":"PRINT03-COUNTERBORES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Dimensioned intent","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"Each screw recess is a cylindrical 6.5 mm diameter by 2.5 mm deep counterbore from the sole, never a conical countersink or tapped hole, with at least 2.0 mm external wall."},{"id":"PRINT03-PAD-RECESS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Dimensioned intent","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"A 16 by 28 mm recess centered at (13,19) is 1.0 mm deep normal to the sloped sole with 2 mm corner rounds and does not add printed rubber geometry."},{"id":"PRINT03-CABLE-KEEPOUT","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/prompt.txt","locator":"keepout request","sha256":"053c1f0df93c455b1b008dadda5a49bf9417ae823329389521620fa37e8ec688"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Dimensioned intent","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"The rear-right region X=21..26,Y=31..38 is removed for the full body depth with a 2 mm internal fillet."},{"id":"PRINT03-HANDEDNESS","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/prompt.txt","locator":"handedness instruction","sha256":"053c1f0df93c455b1b008dadda5a49bf9417ae823329389521620fa37e8ec688"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Product and use assumptions","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"The model remains the specified rear-left part and is not automatically mirrored for the other side."},{"id":"PRINT03-MESH-LINEAGE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"053c1f0df93c455b1b008dadda5a49bf9417ae823329389521620fa37e8ec688"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Manufacturing capability and policy","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"Source and repaired printable meshes remain separate and the final slice binds to the reviewed repaired-mesh revision."},{"id":"PRINT03-SLICE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Manufacturing capability and policy","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"The final package uses confirmed P1S 0.4 mm PETG profiles, 0.16 mm layers, five perimeters and 45% infill; any PLA package is labeled PLA."},{"id":"PRINT03-SUPPORT","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/context.md","locator":"Manufacturing capability and policy","sha256":"1d5e1247e2543e0719bc8e556adb9ffaeea2adf923d7ec977375983be06df18d"}],"text":"Support planning avoids screw bores and the pad seating face where orientation permits and retains actual support evidence for any sculpted-side supports."},{"id":"PRINT03-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/printed-replacement-part/03-synthesizer-tilt-foot/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"053c1f0df93c455b1b008dadda5a49bf9417ae823329389521620fa37e8ec688"}],"text":"The output set contains inspectable source mesh, repaired STL, support-aware P1S PETG package and a digest-bound simulator-only transfer receipt."},{"id":"PRINT03-ACTION-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/sce